OL,3,AHidden museum gallery to reopen after
OL,4,A83 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gallery that has remained closed to
OL,7,Fthe public since World War Two is to
OL,8,Freopen at London's Natural History
OL,9,FMuseum next month.
OL,11,FThe gallery, which has remained hidden
OL,12,Ffrom view since 1943, will reopen from
OL,13,F16 September, featuring 50 objects
OL,14,Fwhich show our evolving relationship
OL,15,Fwith the natural world.
OL,17,FThe exhibition, named Nature and Us, is
OL,18,Fpart of a transformation project called
OL,19,FNHM150, which aims to open a new or
OL,20,Frevamped showcase every year until the
OL,21,Fmuseum's 150th anniversary in 2031.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
