OL,3,AHidden museum gallery to reopen after
OL,4,A83 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Doug Gurr, director of the NHM,
OL,7,Fsaid: "For the first time in over 80
OL,8,Fyears, visitors will be able to step
OL,9,Finto this beautiful historic space and
OL,10,Fexplore our changing relationship with
OL,11,Fthe natural world."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
